stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Init : Reset / Power-on

    Init : Initialization<br/>(clocks, peripherals, modules,<br/>load credentials from EEPROM)
    Reg : Initial registration<br/>(registration FSM)
    Ses : Periodic session with the HES<br/>(power modem on · session FSM · power modem off)
    Sleep : Sleep — STOP mode<br/>(only RTC and pulse sensor active)
    Pulse : Pulse count<br/>(EXTI ISR on PA8)

    Init --> Reg : Device not registered
    Init --> Sleep : Already registered

    Reg --> Sleep : Registration OK<br/>(sleep until next_wake)

    Sleep --> Ses : RTC alarm (next_wake)
    Sleep --> Pulse : Pulse on PA8
    Pulse --> Sleep : increment counter<br/>and return to STOP

    Ses --> Sleep : HES ACK (session complete)<br/>or retries exhausted
